    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0402" n="322" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg322"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1031: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Uruguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gade</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-22T11:00:00-03:30">March 22, 1930—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>13. Department’s telegram No. 14, March 21, 5 p.m.<anchor n="44" xml:id="d290-f1"
                    /> Protocol has not yet been signed. As the Minister for Foreign Affairs has
                    been ill the last few days I have been unable to see him. Bolivian Minister
                    informed me this morning that his Government has authorized him to sign protocol
                    but amending it to fix May 1 instead of April 10 as the date for the renewal of
                    diplomatic relations between Bolivia and Paraguay.</p>
                <p>I believe delay in signing is due either to the illness of the Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs or to possible desire of the Paraguayan Minister to refer
                    question of the changed date to his Government.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Asunción.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gade</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d290-f1" n="44" xml:id="d290-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it asked whether the Bolivia-Paraguay protocol had been signed and
                    if not, the cause of the delay.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
